-- ============================================================================
-- This is the creator portal's reset migration history. It was generated by
-- `prisma migrate diff --from-empty --to-schema-datamodel prisma/schema.prisma`
-- from the schema that the running service actually queries, and it SUPERSEDES
-- every earlier migration directory (which was deleted in the same change).
--
-- Why baseline: the deployed azeebo_creator database's migration history
-- diverged from this repo's (a wallet-retirement migration recorded there was
-- absent here, and vice versa), so fresh databases and drifted databases kept
-- needing idempotent repair migrations. See 20260928110000 baseline note in
-- RUNBOOK / CHECKS: adopt with `prisma migrate resolve --applied` (baselined
-- databases) or `prisma migrate deploy` (fresh databases).
--
-- Regenerate rather than hand-edit:
--   npx prisma migrate diff --from-empty --to-schema-datamodel prisma/schema.prisma --script
-- ============================================================================

